      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MODS (2) sets the standard after three straight wins, the latest a four-and-a-half-length success at this track when well-supported favourite in Saturday company. He now comes into an easier meeting, has been effective around 1200m across his career, and the Billy Cray partnership is three wins from three. CRAZY BRAVE (6) has not matched that winning edge this campaign, but he is third-up, proven at this track and trip, and the first-time visor gives him a clear point of interest after finishing fourth behind MODS last time. ALAA PLENTY (1) drops out of a BM70 after racing wide when third here, and his broader 1200m record keeps him in the mix despite the margin. MEET ME AT THE BAR (3) deserves respect off a BM58 win at this venue, though he rises in grade and was well held by MODS two runs back.",
